 on expanding clinical operations and managed services while reducing debt by FY27.","summary":"Sagility Ltd reported strong Q3 FY26 results with revenue at ₹19,712M, up 35.7% YoY, and EBITDA margins at 26%. Medicare AEP season drove exceptional performance.\nThe company increased FY26 revenue growth guidance to 22.5% in constant currency. Focus remains on expanding clinical operations and managed services while reducing debt by FY27.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=87161962-3bfa-4c5d-9e10-4eee5ab250da.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-03T12:03:59","source":"BSE"},{"id":"457881","title":"Sagility Ltd disclosed the video recording of its investor webinar discussing Q3 FY25 results.\nThe recording is available on Sagility's website under the investor relations section.","summary":"Sagility Ltd disclosed the video recording of its investor webinar discussing Q3 FY25 results.\nThe recording is available on Sagility's website under the investor relations section.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1bf86e1e-c767-4e27-a41f-f2beec135c3c.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-29T09:07:19","source":"BSE"},{"id":"804337293810211584","title":"Sagility Ltd's Q3 FY25 revenue stood at Rs 19,712M with PBT of Rs 3,385M.\nA one-time Rs 328M impact from Labour Codes and BroadPath acquisition for $55.7M noted.","summary":"Sagility Ltd's Q3 FY25 revenue stood at Rs 19,712M with PBT of Rs 3,385M.\nA one-time Rs 328M impact from Labour Codes and BroadPath acquisition for $55.7M noted.","url":"https://sqst.in/CYcsb","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-28T18:39:14","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"445488","title":"Sagility Ltd will host an earnings webinar on Jan 28, 2026, at 7:30 PM IST to discuss Q3 FY26 financial results.\nThe session includes management commentary, operational highlights, and a Q&A with CEO Ramesh Gopalan and CFO Abhishek Kayan.","summary":"Sagility Ltd will host an earnings webinar on Jan 28, 2026, at 7: